(4456552, 641900, 74979, '<td valign="top">spaetzle?  hmm doesn''t look very appetizing at this close up! :)  good image, nice &amp; clear &amp; I love the blurred hand onthe right saying "come on eat this"</td>', 'spaetzle?  hmm doesn''t look very appetizing at this close up! :)  good image, nice & clear & I love the blurred hand onthe right saying "come on eat this"', '2008-02-04 08:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456557, 641672, 70661, '<td valign="top">This made me think. I can remember my grandparents car and the way it smelled and that was forty some years ago. It''s funny the things we remember. Nice photo of a good memory! (I hope it''s a good one for you!)</td>', 'This made me think. I can remember my grandparents car and the way it smelled and that was forty some years ago. It''s funny the things we remember. Nice photo of a good memory! (I hope it''s a good one for you!)', '2008-02-04 08:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
