(4456963, 642078, 87252, '<td valign="top">Good idea but i''m not keen on the harsh shadow on the spring. Also possibly the shot might been more interesting from a more acute angle than this. Finally I don''t understand the title particularly, why the question mark?</td>', 'Good idea but i''m not keen on the harsh shadow on the spring. Also possibly the shot might been more interesting from a more acute angle than this. Finally I don''t understand the title particularly, why the question mark?', '2008-02-04 10:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456985, 641497, 87252, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but this shot lacks a point of interest (unless you count the washed up bottle). This might grab the attention more if, for example, there were kids playing in the distance, or a big yellow parasol where the bottle is.</td>', 'Nice idea but this shot lacks a point of interest (unless you count the washed up bottle). This might grab the attention more if, for example, there were kids playing in the distance, or a big yellow parasol where the bottle is.', '2008-02-04 11:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4456993, 641084, 87252, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand! What is Earliest Memory "of a parasol"? You''ve got some cool DOF going on here but there''s no particular point of interest (or content for that matter). If there''s some clever twist I''ve missed here i''ll put my hands up and admit that, but to me this is just a grey square.</td>', 'I don''t understand! What is Earliest Memory "of a parasol"? You''ve got some cool DOF going on here but there''s no particular point of interest (or content for that matter). If there''s some clever twist I''ve missed here i''ll put my hands up and admit that, but to me this is just a grey square.', '2008-02-04 11:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457000, 641895, 87252, '<td valign="top">I know pretty much anything COULD be your first memory, but this is hard to put into context without a title. Not sure this meets the challenge.</td>', 'I know pretty much anything COULD be your first memory, but this is hard to put into context without a title. Not sure this meets the challenge.', '2008-02-04 11:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
