(4457101, 641193, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great image!  Who doesn''t remember the dreaded itch and the smell of calomine lotion.  Love the processing and title.  Simple composition but with lovely dark undertones.  +1 for being counter-eyecandy :)</td>', 'Great image!  Who doesn''t remember the dreaded itch and the smell of calomine lotion.  Love the processing and title.  Simple composition but with lovely dark undertones.  +1 for being counter-eyecandy :)', '2008-02-04 12:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457109, 642095, 85886, '<td valign="top">THAT''S OBSCENE!  Do you work for Abercrombie and Fitch marketing department by chance? ;)  Lovely photo - great fun and perfect positioning.  Also for once ducky makes an appropriate appearance.  What I want to know is how did you manage to get back in the bucket after hitting the 10s timer?!  You and Houdini eh?</td>', 'THAT''S OBSCENE!  Do you work for Abercrombie and Fitch marketing department by chance? ;)  Lovely photo - great fun and perfect positioning.  Also for once ducky makes an appropriate appearance.  What I want to know is how did you manage to get back in the bucket after hitting the 10s timer?!  You and Houdini eh?', '2008-02-04 12:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457113, 640913, 85886, '<td valign="top">Nice one - this is what I had in mind but couldn''t get the props together.  Nicely executed too.  +1 for the "wish I''d done that" factor :)</td>', 'Nice one - this is what I had in mind but couldn''t get the props together.  Nicely executed too.  +1 for the "wish I''d done that" factor :)', '2008-02-04 12:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457115, 640982, 85886, '<td valign="top">The grain and focus really work well, as does the square crop and b&amp;w - which for me gives a real ''memory'' feel.  I think you''ve met the challenge better than most so far by it being such an evocative shot/edit.</td>', 'The grain and focus really work well, as does the square crop and b&w - which for me gives a real ''memory'' feel.  I think you''ve met the challenge better than most so far by it being such an evocative shot/edit.', '2008-02-04 12:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457121, 640377, 85886, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot - it''s really appealing.  Funny title, but nicely poignant image and great choice of props.  The lighting and contrast in colour between Raggedy Ann and the rocking chair give it an almost partial desat feel without doing it.  Very nice.</td>', 'I really like this shot - it''s really appealing.  Funny title, but nicely poignant image and great choice of props.  The lighting and contrast in colour between Raggedy Ann and the rocking chair give it an almost partial desat feel without doing it.  Very nice.', '2008-02-04 12:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457128, 641461, 85886, '<td valign="top">Aha!  Another birthday view.  I wanted to do this shot but didn''t get hold of the props.  I actually like yours more than the other one that I''ve just seen because of the depth of field and wider shot.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Aha!  Another birthday view.  I wanted to do this shot but didn''t get hold of the props.  I actually like yours more than the other one that I''ve just seen because of the depth of field and wider shot.  Very nicely done.', '2008-02-04 12:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457133, 641649, 85886, '<td valign="top">YIIIIIIIIIIIKES!!!!  I HATE SPIDERS!!  That scared the living crap out of me!  Now I''m fully scrolled up so that I can type this and vote without having that horrible scary big black hairy spider macro staring at me!  I think from the 2 or 3s of ''what the heck is that..oh sh!t it''s a spider'' it was a nicely focussed shot and definitely a great childhood memory to capture...but I dare not go back and check.  Double yikes with cheese.  To go.</td>', 'YIIIIIIIIIIIKES!!!!  I HATE SPIDERS!!  That scared the living crap out of me!  Now I''m fully scrolled up so that I can type this and vote without having that horrible scary big black hairy spider macro staring at me!  I think from the 2 or 3s of ''what the heck is that..oh sh!t it''s a spider'' it was a nicely focussed shot and definitely a great childhood memory to capture...but I dare not go back and check.  Double yikes with cheese.  To go.', '2008-02-04 12:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457139, 641782, 85886, '<td valign="top">Grain, light and toning used to brilliant effect, plus the fuzziness in the legs providing movement.  Really beautiful shot and genuinely evocative of yesteryear childhood memories - even to the detail of her skirt and shoes.  Absolutely brilliant interpretation and execution.</td>', 'Grain, light and toning used to brilliant effect, plus the fuzziness in the legs providing movement.  Really beautiful shot and genuinely evocative of yesteryear childhood memories - even to the detail of her skirt and shoes.  Absolutely brilliant interpretation and execution.', '2008-02-04 12:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457142, 639676, 85886, '<td valign="top">Original and well shot.  Ahhh...lunchboxes...those were the days.</td>', 'Original and well shot.  Ahhh...lunchboxes...those were the days.', '2008-02-04 12:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457148, 642085, 85886, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - the legs make it feel much more real than the others I''ve seen here.  Also makes it feel a bit more uncomfortable rather than comical as the others have done, but still a very good shot.</td>', 'Nicely done - the legs make it feel much more real than the others I''ve seen here.  Also makes it feel a bit more uncomfortable rather than comical as the others have done, but still a very good shot.', '2008-02-04 12:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457152, 642051, 85886, '<td valign="top">&lt;sesame street&gt; COOOOOOOOKIE &lt;/sesame street&gt;.  Nice memory and well shot.  I like the crop, plus the dipped oreo.  Very appealing and is making my mouth water right now.  Care to send me some Double Stuf oreos to London?! :)</td>', '<sesame street> COOOOOOOOKIE </sesame street>.  Nice memory and well shot.  I like the crop, plus the dipped oreo.  Very appealing and is making my mouth water right now.  Care to send me some Double Stuf oreos to London?! :)', '2008-02-04 12:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457157, 641695, 85886, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Very funny and really original submission.  Shame the clock isn''t sharper though.</td>', 'LOL!  Very funny and really original submission.  Shame the clock isn''t sharper though.', '2008-02-04 12:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457159, 641198, 85886, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done</td>', 'Very nicely done', '2008-02-04 12:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457162, 641423, 85886, '<td valign="top">Feeding your camera again?  Oh deary me!  Nice shot - I like the square crop and the DoF seems just right, with the spoon pin sharp and enough of you recognizable.</td>', 'Feeding your camera again?  Oh deary me!  Nice shot - I like the square crop and the DoF seems just right, with the spoon pin sharp and enough of you recognizable.', '2008-02-04 12:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457172, 641958, 85886, '<td valign="top">OMG - is that the inside of a red pepper??!  Took me more than a few seconds to work out what is going on here and I think you''ll suffer at the hands of the voters for it.  Strong image once it clicks though, just technically a bit weak  even if you were going for a newborn''s fuzzy vision.</td>', 'OMG - is that the inside of a red pepper??!  Took me more than a few seconds to work out what is going on here and I think you''ll suffer at the hands of the voters for it.  Strong image once it clicks though, just technically a bit weak  even if you were going for a newborn''s fuzzy vision.', '2008-02-04 12:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457181, 640766, 85886, '<td valign="top">If you''re trying to convey the myriad of different and strange colours and shapes I think you need a lower PoV.  This is at adult height and therefore doesn''t convey early memories at all and just appears like an overprocessed photo.</td>', 'If you''re trying to convey the myriad of different and strange colours and shapes I think you need a lower PoV.  This is at adult height and therefore doesn''t convey early memories at all and just appears like an overprocessed photo.', '2008-02-04 12:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457187, 642121, 85886, '<td valign="top">My favourite so far - this is brilliant in it''s simplicity, but more specifically the colours and that Fisher Price toy in particular are really evocative of early play and the associated memories.  I love the crop and the negative space, the lustre on the rings themselves...there''s nothing I can say that I think would help make it a better photo.  10 from me.</td>', 'My favourite so far - this is brilliant in it''s simplicity, but more specifically the colours and that Fisher Price toy in particular are really evocative of early play and the associated memories.  I love the crop and the negative space, the lustre on the rings themselves...there''s nothing I can say that I think would help make it a better photo.  10 from me.', '2008-02-04 12:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4457191, 641804, 85886, '<td valign="top">This was more like my earliest memory.  Nicely composed with lovely colours and lighting.  On the downside the tonemapping or shadow work has really been affected by noise and in an advanced challenge like this you could select and blur, or burn those to reduce the effect of that grain.  I think if you were to fix the graining in teh whole image and maybe even push the colours a bit harder (and a sharp) this would really really pop.</td>', 'This was more like my earliest memory.  Nicely composed with lovely colours and lighting.  On the downside the tonemapping or shadow work has really been affected by noise and in an advanced challenge like this you could select and blur, or burn those to reduce the effect of that grain.  I think if you were to fix the graining in teh whole image and maybe even push the colours a bit harder (and a sharp) this would really really pop.', '2008-02-04 12:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
