(4467107, 641198, 70514, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this was a long exposure?  Very nice use to make your point.  Love the colors and composition.</td>', 'I''m guessing this was a long exposure?  Very nice use to make your point.  Love the colors and composition.', '2008-02-07 01:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467113, 641886, 70514, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit tilted and as if the wb is off.  Still a great looking car and lovely backdrop.</td>', 'Seems a bit tilted and as if the wb is off.  Still a great looking car and lovely backdrop.', '2008-02-07 01:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467117, 641463, 70514, '<td valign="top">Emotive hardly does this justice.  Love the detail in the hands and the item she''s crocheting.  Perfect conversion for this.</td>', 'Emotive hardly does this justice.  Love the detail in the hands and the item she''s crocheting.  Perfect conversion for this.', '2008-02-07 01:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467119, 641972, 70514, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of the lens and great processing.  Made me giggle out loud.</td>', 'Wonderful use of the lens and great processing.  Made me giggle out loud.', '2008-02-07 01:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467120, 641919, 70514, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s the wonderful grin or the rosy cheeks that get your point across, but it works!  Simple and very effective.</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s the wonderful grin or the rosy cheeks that get your point across, but it works!  Simple and very effective.', '2008-02-07 01:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467123, 641547, 70514, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and dof, great composition as well.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and dof, great composition as well.', '2008-02-07 01:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467124, 640618, 70514, '<td valign="top">The colors are so pretty and vibrant, I could bbarely see the wasp (?).</td>', 'The colors are so pretty and vibrant, I could bbarely see the wasp (?).', '2008-02-07 01:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467128, 641377, 70514, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing and lines throughout.</td>', 'I really like the processing and lines throughout.', '2008-02-07 01:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467130, 641342, 70514, '<td valign="top">Sooooo sweet.  Gotta love the argyle socks with diaper.  Nice processing to add the feeling of time.</td>', 'Sooooo sweet.  Gotta love the argyle socks with diaper.  Nice processing to add the feeling of time.', '2008-02-07 01:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467133, 642112, 70514, '<td valign="top">HA!  I forgot about that stuff!  Glad my kids haven''t discovered it.  Great macro.  Nice mirror images.  (that stuff really was magical!)</td>', 'HA!  I forgot about that stuff!  Glad my kids haven''t discovered it.  Great macro.  Nice mirror images.  (that stuff really was magical!)', '2008-02-07 01:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467138, 640377, 70514, '<td valign="top">A lost time captured quite lovingly.</td>', 'A lost time captured quite lovingly.', '2008-02-07 01:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467143, 641867, 70514, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and tender.  Love the softness and expressions.</td>', 'Beautiful and tender.  Love the softness and expressions.', '2008-02-07 01:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467146, 642074, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice processing and use of grain.  Great use of composition as well.</td>', 'Nice processing and use of grain.  Great use of composition as well.', '2008-02-07 01:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467149, 640105, 70514, '<td valign="top">Love it, just wish there were less border.</td>', 'Love it, just wish there were less border.', '2008-02-07 01:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467155, 641649, 70514, '<td valign="top">I hate spiders, but wow.  You really got a great shot here.  Better you than me, I say, to waking up to this!</td>', 'I hate spiders, but wow.  You really got a great shot here.  Better you than me, I say, to waking up to this!', '2008-02-07 01:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467361, 641782, 48471, '<td valign="top">For a moment you tricked me, the image has the almost perfect look to be a first memory. But, after paying a bit of attention, I thought: can the first memory be dynamic? I mean, here''s this lovely lady walking and she''ll pass pretty soon. So, how will this image be imprinted on a kid''s mind and stay there for so long? I think this is a reconstruction of several first memories. And, a perfect one at that, a very good telling of a story. Even her dress, the chairs, the table, remind me of my aunt, and that''s really pushing my memories way back.</td>', 'For a moment you tricked me, the image has the almost perfect look to be a first memory. But, after paying a bit of attention, I thought: can the first memory be dynamic? I mean, here''s this lovely lady walking and she''ll pass pretty soon. So, how will this image be imprinted on a kid''s mind and stay there for so long? I think this is a reconstruction of several first memories. And, a perfect one at that, a very good telling of a story. Even her dress, the chairs, the table, remind me of my aunt, and that''s really pushing my memories way back.', '2008-02-07 05:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467363, 640223, 48471, '<td valign="top">I had these kinds of shoes... Or my sister did? I''m not sure, maybe we both had... But, definitely these kind of shoes are part of my very early life. <br/>Good memories. Good realization, a nice control of light and depth of field that is comaparable with the images of the first memories on my brain.</td>', 'I had these kinds of shoes... Or my sister did? I''m not sure, maybe we both had... But, definitely these kind of shoes are part of my very early life. Good memories. Good realization, a nice control of light and depth of field that is comaparable with the images of the first memories on my brain.', '2008-02-07 05:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467385, 642111, 48471, '<td valign="top">Alone in the woods is a mamory that I can''t perceive. There''s a nice forrest next to the city I grew up and my school used to regularly organize regularly trips to the forrest. But, my memories from the forrest are full with children, friends, noise, food, balls, games, teachers...<br/>Growing up in the nature is a healthy way to try to understand the world and the life. I''m glad you present your first memory as an image from nature.</td>', 'Alone in the woods is a mamory that I can''t perceive. There''s a nice forrest next to the city I grew up and my school used to regularly organize regularly trips to the forrest. But, my memories from the forrest are full with children, friends, noise, food, balls, games, teachers...Growing up in the nature is a healthy way to try to understand the world and the life. I''m glad you present your first memory as an image from nature.', '2008-02-07 06:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467393, 641895, 48471, '<td valign="top">Hands add a good human feeling to the image, and monochrome conversion is done masterfully. But, the first memory thing is that''s bothering me: how could a first memory be a camera? I remember that I had a rocket, a train, lego-like toys, I even remember my first camera, but all these things came after I could speak and graps the idea of the camera (rocket, train, etc), and in the mean time I had accumulated a lot of other memories.<br/> <br/>Nevertheless, your image is a fine one and could very well be a first memory.</td>', 'Hands add a good human feeling to the image, and monochrome conversion is done masterfully. But, the first memory thing is that''s bothering me: how could a first memory be a camera? I remember that I had a rocket, a train, lego-like toys, I even remember my first camera, but all these things came after I could speak and graps the idea of the camera (rocket, train, etc), and in the mean time I had accumulated a lot of other memories. Nevertheless, your image is a fine one and could very well be a first memory.', '2008-02-07 06:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467399, 642040, 48471, '<td valign="top">Is this the memory of the first fish that got out of the waters and decided to walk the Earth?<br/> <br/>A nice image that I can comprehend, I remember my early days in the sea. We went to the sea once a year, so it was quite an event. I wish I could remember such dramatic skies and waves and all that, but I can''t - it''s blue sky, nice sand, calm sea, jellyfish hurting, drinking salty sea water...<br/> <br/>As for the technalities of your image, I''ll point out that I like the horizontal lines of the waves and the radial, almost vertical lines of the sunrays. The top dark cloud that covers the entire top part of the image stops my eyes for going up, so I''m back to the bottom, where the ocean waves are. Nice rhythm, although too dramatic for a calm image that (I don''t know why) I expect.</td>', 'Is this the memory of the first fish that got out of the waters and decided to walk the Earth? A nice image that I can comprehend, I remember my early days in the sea. We went to the sea once a year, so it was quite an event. I wish I could remember such dramatic skies and waves and all that, but I can''t - it''s blue sky, nice sand, calm sea, jellyfish hurting, drinking salty sea water... As for the technalities of your image, I''ll point out that I like the horizontal lines of the waves and the radial, almost vertical lines of the sunrays. The top dark cloud that covers the entire top part of the image stops my eyes for going up, so I''m back to the bottom, where the ocean waves are. Nice rhythm, although too dramatic for a calm image that (I don''t know why) I expect.', '2008-02-07 06:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467404, 642085, 48471, '<td valign="top">Good symmetry, good colours. Those red toe nails are funny.</td>', 'Good symmetry, good colours. Those red toe nails are funny.', '2008-02-07 06:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467407, 641926, 48471, '<td valign="top">I end up looking at the bear on the hand of the grandfather, which is looking at the big bear sitting on some sort of a chair. I''m sure you didn''t want me to look there.</td>', 'I end up looking at the bear on the hand of the grandfather, which is looking at the big bear sitting on some sort of a chair. I''m sure you didn''t want me to look there.', '2008-02-07 06:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467436, 641672, 48471, '<td valign="top">The funny point of view is supposed to coincide with the view that you as a child had. But then, how come this, otherwise cool grandma, doesn''t feel scared about where your head is?<br/> <br/>Grandparents and automobiles fill a big part of ones first memories and your choice of subject is to be saluted. The control of light, as well.</td>', 'The funny point of view is supposed to coincide with the view that you as a child had. But then, how come this, otherwise cool grandma, doesn''t feel scared about where your head is? Grandparents and automobiles fill a big part of ones first memories and your choice of subject is to be saluted. The control of light, as well.', '2008-02-07 06:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467437, 640618, 48471, '<td valign="top">Vivid colours to go with a painful, but strong, I''m sure, memory.</td>', 'Vivid colours to go with a painful, but strong, I''m sure, memory.', '2008-02-07 06:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467438, 641762, 48471, '<td valign="top">Yes yes, this brings back some of the earliest memories. So true. I know this image, I remember now.</td>', 'Yes yes, this brings back some of the earliest memories. So true. I know this image, I remember now.', '2008-02-07 06:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467442, 641492, 48471, '<td valign="top">But, how can this be your memory? Memories are stored in the brain, and here I see the starting stage of forming the brain and everything else.<br/> <br/>I like the idea, with the title it''s a wonderful presentation. I like the almost metaphysical colours and shapes.</td>', 'But, how can this be your memory? Memories are stored in the brain, and here I see the starting stage of forming the brain and everything else. I like the idea, with the title it''s a wonderful presentation. I like the almost metaphysical colours and shapes.', '2008-02-07 06:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467449, 642099, 48471, '<td valign="top">Good subject, books are part of my earliest memories, so I understand the story you''re telling. <br/>I like the warm colours, and the smiling kinds on the cover. A very good control of the depth of field. I wish you''d included some hands, so that to add some life to this image.</td>', 'Good subject, books are part of my earliest memories, so I understand the story you''re telling. I like the warm colours, and the smiling kinds on the cover. A very good control of the depth of field. I wish you''d included some hands, so that to add some life to this image.', '2008-02-07 06:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467456, 642009, 48471, '<td valign="top">You made me remember my first bicycle. I never had a toy like this one. I wish there were a couple of legs or hands, so that there is some life to this image... On the other hand, there needn''t be any, because the memory belongs to a far away time.. But then, why isn''t the wagon in distance, so that I have to look for it?</td>', 'You made me remember my first bicycle. I never had a toy like this one. I wish there were a couple of legs or hands, so that there is some life to this image... On the other hand, there needn''t be any, because the memory belongs to a far away time.. But then, why isn''t the wagon in distance, so that I have to look for it?', '2008-02-07 06:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467460, 641547, 48471, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field here, it reveals just a little, the same way as memories are, bits and pieces...</td>', 'I like the depth of field here, it reveals just a little, the same way as memories are, bits and pieces...', '2008-02-07 07:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467467, 641886, 48471, '<td valign="top">I''m looking at the mountains, they''re beautiful, magnificent...remind me of my mountains at my place. <br/>I grew up pretending to drive a car standing still in the garage, listening to the Beatles and Led Zepellin and Pink Floyd and Deep Purple in the car''s radio. Now, I don''t care about cars, I don''t even drive, but I love music.</td>', 'I''m looking at the mountains, they''re beautiful, magnificent...remind me of my mountains at my place. I grew up pretending to drive a car standing still in the garage, listening to the Beatles and Led Zepellin and Pink Floyd and Deep Purple in the car''s radio. Now, I don''t care about cars, I don''t even drive, but I love music.', '2008-02-07 07:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467470, 641933, 48471, '<td valign="top">A slice of moon in the sky, a rhythm of waves on the lake...</td>', 'A slice of moon in the sky, a rhythm of waves on the lake...', '2008-02-07 07:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467471, 641663, 48471, '<td valign="top">Nice exercise, nice gradient of light.</td>', 'Nice exercise, nice gradient of light.', '2008-02-07 07:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467472, 640590, 48471, '<td valign="top">Beautiful woman, with strong facial features.</td>', 'Beautiful woman, with strong facial features.', '2008-02-07 07:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467475, 641193, 48471, '<td valign="top">Ha, now you brought back some memories. Yes, scratch scratch scratch, and in the meantime cry... Then some cold white powder over the body...<br/> <br/>Nice realization, wonderful idea, very good, indeed very good.</td>', 'Ha, now you brought back some memories. Yes, scratch scratch scratch, and in the meantime cry... Then some cold white powder over the body... Nice realization, wonderful idea, very good, indeed very good.', '2008-02-07 07:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467476, 641423, 48471, '<td valign="top">I remember another mother feeding another kid, and we, that''s I and many kids, would start dancing and singing once the troublemaking kid ate. It''s fun even now, many many years after, remembering the eating ceremony.</td>', 'I remember another mother feeding another kid, and we, that''s I and many kids, would start dancing and singing once the troublemaking kid ate. It''s fun even now, many many years after, remembering the eating ceremony.', '2008-02-07 07:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467479, 641811, 48471, '<td valign="top">Just a technical note: cutting ones head with the background line, which is going straight at his nose, is quite disturbing. Even the moderately shallow depth of field doesn''t help here. Otherwise, technically very well realized photo.</td>', 'Just a technical note: cutting ones head with the background line, which is going straight at his nose, is quite disturbing. Even the moderately shallow depth of field doesn''t help here. Otherwise, technically very well realized photo.', '2008-02-07 07:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467480, 641971, 48471, '<td valign="top">You made me laugh. Yes, growing up in a city surrounded by three rivers, I threw a lot of stones into water. But, the glass? Nice play.</td>', 'You made me laugh. Yes, growing up in a city surrounded by three rivers, I threw a lot of stones into water. But, the glass? Nice play.', '2008-02-07 07:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467483, 641577, 48471, '<td valign="top">Warm smiles. I wish the colours were more vibrant, I think it would have added to the life of this image.</td>', 'Warm smiles. I wish the colours were more vibrant, I think it would have added to the life of this image.', '2008-02-07 07:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467486, 641377, 48471, '<td valign="top">The Sun, that magnificent light-giver, he''s shed some wonderful light in the background. I can even see the mountains! So nice... And then I come to the front and see these ships, resting calmly. It looks like a painting.</td>', 'The Sun, that magnificent light-giver, he''s shed some wonderful light in the background. I can even see the mountains! So nice... And then I come to the front and see these ships, resting calmly. It looks like a painting.', '2008-02-07 07:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467487, 641630, 48471, '<td valign="top">Actually, you reminded me of my tiger T-shirt.</td>', 'Actually, you reminded me of my tiger T-shirt.', '2008-02-07 07:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467491, 641900, 48471, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I like how just a small, a very small part of the face is shown. Otherwise, the image isn''t pleasing, the colours seem odd, the food isn''t appealing... They don''t necessarily have to be, but, with a funny title and a message like that, I think it should.</td>', 'Hmmm, I like how just a small, a very small part of the face is shown. Otherwise, the image isn''t pleasing, the colours seem odd, the food isn''t appealing... They don''t necessarily have to be, but, with a funny title and a message like that, I think it should.', '2008-02-07 07:32:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4467497, 641084, 48471, '<td valign="top">Nice exercise, but I don''t see how this could be developed further (in the photographic sense, as an image with a message).<br/>Early memories can very well be abstract, but, are they memories then? Abstract memories? You''ve got me thinking now...<br/>You''ve confused me, I''ll come back when my head is clearer.</td>', 'Nice exercise, but I don''t see how this could be developed further (in the photographic sense, as an image with a message).Early memories can very well be abstract, but, are they memories then? Abstract memories? You''ve got me thinking now...You''ve confused me, I''ll come back when my head is clearer.', '2008-02-07 07:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467503, 642114, 48471, '<td valign="top">I like the slight darkness of the image and the slightly strong shadows on the doll''s face.</td>', 'I like the slight darkness of the image and the slightly strong shadows on the doll''s face.', '2008-02-07 07:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467504, 640766, 48471, '<td valign="top">Good skills, good idea, good title, good image...</td>', 'Good skills, good idea, good title, good image...', '2008-02-07 07:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467507, 640982, 48471, '<td valign="top">Good use of grain, very good use of it.</td>', 'Good use of grain, very good use of it.', '2008-02-07 07:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467508, 642101, 48471, '<td valign="top">Imaginge a socket and adults shouting DON''T PUT YOUR FINGER THERE!, now that''s a memory I can share. Eating bolts, not.<br/>Good depth, good shaprness, good texture, but the light is to strong, to harsh, it hurts.</td>', 'Imaginge a socket and adults shouting DON''T PUT YOUR FINGER THERE!, now that''s a memory I can share. Eating bolts, not.Good depth, good shaprness, good texture, but the light is to strong, to harsh, it hurts.', '2008-02-07 07:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467509, 641804, 48471, '<td valign="top">Such a nice play on colour and light and shadow.</td>', 'Such a nice play on colour and light and shadow.', '2008-02-07 07:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467513, 641958, 48471, '<td valign="top">The best from a bunch that had the same idea.</td>', 'The best from a bunch that had the same idea.', '2008-02-07 07:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467515, 641463, 48471, '<td valign="top">Yes, this brings back memories... But, do they hold the stick (or whatever that knitting needle is called) in such a way? I wish I could see a bit more of what she''s making. Nice placement of hands, nice control of light, good conversion to black and white with a tone.</td>', 'Yes, this brings back memories... But, do they hold the stick (or whatever that knitting needle is called) in such a way? I wish I could see a bit more of what she''s making. Nice placement of hands, nice control of light, good conversion to black and white with a tone.', '2008-02-07 07:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467519, 640105, 48471, '<td valign="top">I can hear her!</td>', 'I can hear her!', '2008-02-07 07:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4467521, 641972, 48471, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of a lens, distortion helps a lot.</td>', 'Nice choice of a lens, distortion helps a lot.', '2008-02-07 08:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468214, 642111, 84124, '<td valign="top">Oh my!  Well done.  I was pretty reved up about this challenge to see what others had to offer, and this is the first one I''ve seen that really captured the "childhood" aspect without being too artificial.  I like it alot.</td>', 'Oh my!  Well done.  I was pretty reved up about this challenge to see what others had to offer, and this is the first one I''ve seen that really captured the "childhood" aspect without being too artificial.  I like it alot.', '2008-02-07 12:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468224, 641377, 84124, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh... second one of the challenge that rings a 35 yr old memory, well done!</td>', 'Ahhhh... second one of the challenge that rings a 35 yr old memory, well done!', '2008-02-07 12:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468278, 641461, 58247, '<td valign="top">This is the best of the "birth" shots. I love your processing with the blurry vision. Great job! 9!</td>', 'This is the best of the "birth" shots. I love your processing with the blurry vision. Great job! 9!', '2008-02-07 12:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468681, 641663, 77683, '<td valign="top">ahhahaha this made me laugh....</td>', 'ahhahaha this made me laugh....', '2008-02-07 15:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468776, 641713, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, and framing, but the lack of sharp focus is going to hurt you a bit on this one.</td>', 'Nice capture, and framing, but the lack of sharp focus is going to hurt you a bit on this one.', '2008-02-07 16:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468784, 641368, 48717, '<td valign="top">I wiss the focus was a bit sharper, nice pic though, perfect fit to challenge.</td>', 'I wiss the focus was a bit sharper, nice pic though, perfect fit to challenge.', '2008-02-07 16:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468787, 641900, 48717, '<td valign="top">Yuck!  But very fitting of the challenge.</td>', 'Yuck!  But very fitting of the challenge.', '2008-02-07 16:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468796, 641886, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, good color and exposure.  I might have liked to see a more creative angle or perspective to make stand out more.</td>', 'Nice picture, good color and exposure.  I might have liked to see a more creative angle or perspective to make stand out more.', '2008-02-07 16:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468801, 642008, 48717, '<td valign="top">Lovely processing.</td>', 'Lovely processing.', '2008-02-07 16:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468805, 641342, 48717, '<td valign="top">Love the processing here.</td>', 'Love the processing here.', '2008-02-07 16:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4468833, 641705, 48717, '<td valign="top">This pic could use a boost from a levels, curves or white balance adjustment.  Your whites are dull, but they could pop a lot more.</td>', 'This pic could use a boost from a levels, curves or white balance adjustment.  Your whites are dull, but they could pop a lot more.', '2008-02-07 16:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469050, 640377, 55892, '<td valign="top">sweet Raggedy Ann!  Great color composition.</td>', 'sweet Raggedy Ann!  Great color composition.', '2008-02-07 18:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469055, 641198, 55892, '<td valign="top">Great baby''s viiw.  Almost makes me "carsick".  If I had thought it looked that blurred I never would have used it for my kids.  Well, they did survive.</td>', 'Great baby''s viiw.  Almost makes me "carsick".  If I had thought it looked that blurred I never would have used it for my kids.  Well, they did survive.', '2008-02-07 18:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469061, 642089, 55892, '<td valign="top">I love the way you used the colors; even though they are fairly close to each other on the color spectrum they each stand out without one overtaking over the other.</td>', 'I love the way you used the colors; even though they are fairly close to each other on the color spectrum they each stand out without one overtaking over the other.', '2008-02-07 18:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469071, 641958, 48697, '<td valign="top">definitely the most realistic of this take in the challenge.</td>', 'definitely the most realistic of this take in the challenge.', '2008-02-07 18:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469077, 640766, 48697, '<td valign="top">very interesting PP in this shot, looks ike a scetch that is partially colored in.  As a child you probably focus on the moveent and people and ignore alot of other things, this defintly gives that feeling b/c of the PP. Well done. I''m afraid that this might be beyond basic but I''ve been fooled before so I don''t vote down for that, 10 for originality and nice PP.</td>', 'very interesting PP in this shot, looks ike a scetch that is partially colored in.  As a child you probably focus on the moveent and people and ignore alot of other things, this defintly gives that feeling b/c of the PP. Well done. I''m afraid that this might be beyond basic but I''ve been fooled before so I don''t vote down for that, 10 for originality and nice PP.', '2008-02-07 18:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469081, 642095, 48697, '<td valign="top">some people never grow up:) nice job Judi, looks like buckets of fun!</td>', 'some people never grow up:) nice job Judi, looks like buckets of fun!', '2008-02-07 18:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
