(4469628, 642095, 63495, '<td valign="top">great shot, I remember thoose tub baths by the old wood stove. it would hard for me to get out of that tub.</td>', 'great shot, I remember thoose tub baths by the old wood stove. it would hard for me to get out of that tub.', '2008-02-07 22:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4469660, 642000, 90005, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the dirty little fingernails.  I think the image would be ok, average pretty, without it. But its the child''s fingernails that tell the story.  I love  that the dirt under the nails makes me want to know more about the mom. I LOVE the fact that she isn''t a "perfect (in the traditional sense) mother,"  but more alive more natural, more real. I also think the wood with the nails really works.  good job!</td>', 'I LOVE the dirty little fingernails.  I think the image would be ok, average pretty, without it. But its the child''s fingernails that tell the story.  I love  that the dirt under the nails makes me want to know more about the mom. I LOVE the fact that she isn''t a "perfect (in the traditional sense) mother,"  but more alive more natural, more real. I also think the wood with the nails really works.  good job!', '2008-02-07 22:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
