(4475383, 641971, 46314, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred a more literal take on this subject. I''m sure you had fun executing this though</td>', 'Would have preferred a more literal take on this subject. I''m sure you had fun executing this though', '2008-02-10 14:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
