(4476141, 641084, 50695, '<td valign="top">His earliest memory was the round shape of the sun at the top of his stroller. His mother would be chatting away to some other mother, and he thought it was the sun talking to him.</td>', 'His earliest memory was the round shape of the sun at the top of his stroller. His mother would be chatting away to some other mother, and he thought it was the sun talking to him.', '2008-02-10 22:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
