(4476179, 641895, 48697, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, I will admit that at first I thought to myself that what ever that ladder looking thing in the frame is is too distracting, what the hell is it doing in this shot.  Then it hit me, the crib rail. Great perspective and cool idea, maybe a bit more rail could help the viewer. I like the b&amp;w and the old camera make this a nice fit for the challenge. 8</td>', 'I like this shot, I will admit that at first I thought to myself that what ever that ladder looking thing in the frame is is too distracting, what the hell is it doing in this shot.  Then it hit me, the crib rail. Great perspective and cool idea, maybe a bit more rail could help the viewer. I like the b&w and the old camera make this a nice fit for the challenge. 8', '2008-02-10 22:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4476185, 641971, 48697, '<td valign="top">really cool shot, though the black bottom is a bit distracting.  I will say that I feel that this is a bit of a shoehorn to the challenge, but then again maybe as a kid you threw rocks into glasses of wate:)</td>', 'really cool shot, though the black bottom is a bit distracting.  I will say that I feel that this is a bit of a shoehorn to the challenge, but then again maybe as a kid you threw rocks into glasses of wate:)', '2008-02-10 22:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
