(4476189, 641347, 48697, '<td valign="top">I kind of lost regarding the title.  The picture seems to be suffering from lots of posterization in the sky and excessive image grain.</td>', 'I kind of lost regarding the title.  The picture seems to be suffering from lots of posterization in the sky and excessive image grain.', '2008-02-10 22:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
