(4476547, 641972, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Jeni!  Very imaginative and great storytelling. :)</td>', 'Congrats, Jeni!  Very imaginative and great storytelling. :)', '2008-02-11 01:00:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4476559, 641782, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow, are you on a roll lately.  Congrats big time!  Just a fantastic photo, so rich with meaning.  Thanks for sharing your memory with us.  As I looked at it, I thought "boy, I hope posthumous saw this."  So congrats on winning that blue!  You''re probably making Don squirm - he doesn''t usually like the ones that do well overall. *grin*</td>', 'Wow, are you on a roll lately.  Congrats big time!  Just a fantastic photo, so rich with meaning.  Thanks for sharing your memory with us.  As I looked at it, I thought "boy, I hope posthumous saw this."  So congrats on winning that blue!  You''re probably making Don squirm - he doesn''t usually like the ones that do well overall. *grin*', '2008-02-11 01:03:18.000000', NULL, 0),
