(4477454, 641630, 50695, '<td valign="top">Only a handful of people created the "visual feeling" of a memory (I wasn''t one of them). <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30861" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bear_Music</a> did it. So did <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=65234" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">MaryO</a>. This was the boldest attempt. Good work!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-11 09:07:54.</i></td>', 'Only a handful of people created the "visual feeling" of a memory (I wasn''t one of them).  Bear_Music did it. So did  MaryO. This was the boldest attempt. Good work!', '2008-02-11 09:07:32.000000', '2008-02-11 09:07:54.000000', 0),
