(4477469, 642089, 50695, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this scored under 5. I admit I''m not crazy about shots of things, but as thing-shots go, this is a good one. The composition has some energy, one can imagine the horse actually running into the frame. The lighting is warm and three-dimensional. There is a glow of child-worship about it. <br/> <br/>Uh-oh, I just convinced myself that I underrated this picture, too.</td>', 'I can''t believe this scored under 5. I admit I''m not crazy about shots of things, but as thing-shots go, this is a good one. The composition has some energy, one can imagine the horse actually running into the frame. The lighting is warm and three-dimensional. There is a glow of child-worship about it.  Uh-oh, I just convinced myself that I underrated this picture, too.', '2008-02-11 09:15:28.000000', NULL, 0),
