(4477474, 642006, 50695, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t believe how many black backgrounds were in this challenge. I don''t have any memories with black backgrounds, so I was a little tough on them, <i>mea culpa</i>. But the toy itself is wonderful and well-lit.</td>', 'I couldn''t believe how many black backgrounds were in this challenge. I don''t have any memories with black backgrounds, so I was a little tough on them, mea culpa. But the toy itself is wonderful and well-lit.', '2008-02-11 09:17:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4477476, 641342, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m on an anti-HDR kick right now, but this a cool shot. I wasn''t thinking about how the HDR makes this look like an illustration from the 60s. Another example of a DPC voter not giving a photo enough thought! (luckily, most of the other voters outsmarted me)</td>', 'I''m on an anti-HDR kick right now, but this a cool shot. I wasn''t thinking about how the HDR makes this look like an illustration from the 60s. Another example of a DPC voter not giving a photo enough thought! (luckily, most of the other voters outsmarted me)', '2008-02-11 09:19:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4477478, 641972, 86390, '<td valign="top">We never had yellow school buses back in Africa, but this does conjure up the feeling of the first day at school. great shot.</td>', 'We never had yellow school buses back in Africa, but this does conjure up the feeling of the first day at school. great shot.', '2008-02-11 09:21:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4477479, 642114, 50695, '<td valign="top">To me, it looks like she''s underwater in a stormy sea. She doesn''t mind, but the sailor looking into her eyes is terrified.</td>', 'To me, it looks like she''s underwater in a stormy sea. She doesn''t mind, but the sailor looking into her eyes is terrified.', '2008-02-11 09:21:33.000000', NULL, 0),
