(4477492, 642074, 61651, '<td valign="top">I remember trying this as a kid - and also trying to stick my fingers in a fan.  Don''t know what that says about me. :)  I like the composition - how the curve of the hand and finger lead the eye to the scissors.  The posture of the hand is even a bit reminiscent of that in the Sistine Chapel ceiling.</td>', 'I remember trying this as a kid - and also trying to stick my fingers in a fan.  Don''t know what that says about me. :)  I like the composition - how the curve of the hand and finger lead the eye to the scissors.  The posture of the hand is even a bit reminiscent of that in the Sistine Chapel ceiling.', '2008-02-11 09:27:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4477498, 641193, 61651, '<td valign="top">Hopefully that bath gave him some relief from the itching.  Haunting image, and perfect for this challenge.</td>', 'Hopefully that bath gave him some relief from the itching.  Haunting image, and perfect for this challenge.', '2008-02-11 09:28:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4477517, 641084, 61651, '<td valign="top">I think people have forgotten how small children so easily fixate on the simplest of things.  What''s so exciting about the interior of a parasol?  Well, of course!  I appreciate your attempt to get across the feeling of an early memory.</td>', 'I think people have forgotten how small children so easily fixate on the simplest of things.  What''s so exciting about the interior of a parasol?  Well, of course!  I appreciate your attempt to get across the feeling of an early memory.', '2008-02-11 09:32:42.000000', NULL, 0),
