(4477915, 639676, 82088, '<td valign="top">This is another photo that really hits home for me.  My dad also used to pack my lunches and everyday he put in a funny note, usually something like "Roses are red, violets are blue.....something funny that rhymed" I couldn''t wait for lunchtime so that I could read my note from my dad.  I hadn''t thought about that in a long time, so thanks for bringing back a great memory. =)</td>', 'This is another photo that really hits home for me.  My dad also used to pack my lunches and everyday he put in a funny note, usually something like "Roses are red, violets are blue.....something funny that rhymed" I couldn''t wait for lunchtime so that I could read my note from my dad.  I hadn''t thought about that in a long time, so thanks for bringing back a great memory. =)', '2008-02-11 11:48:52.000000', NULL, 0),
