(4478113, 642095, 56744, '<td valign="top">There''s no other way to deal with Judi... You love her or you hate her.<br/>Your score shows that ;)<br/>Congrats for another great job and funny image.</td>', 'There''s no other way to deal with Judi... You love her or you hate her.Your score shows that ;)Congrats for another great job and funny image.', '2008-02-11 13:21:36.000000', NULL, 0),
