(4478159, 642066, 65319, '<td valign="top">Deb...I bet you couldn''t wait for her to wake up.  You were a disciplined child.  My children would have been bouncing on her bed to wake her up...;-)  Although the photo did not receive the appreciation it deserved...the treasures of your memory are warmhearted and thank you for sharing your Oma with all of us!</td>', 'Deb...I bet you couldn''t wait for her to wake up.  You were a disciplined child.  My children would have been bouncing on her bed to wake her up...;-)  Although the photo did not receive the appreciation it deserved...the treasures of your memory are warmhearted and thank you for sharing your Oma with all of us!', '2008-02-11 13:39:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4478162, 642066, 67697, '<td valign="top">Sorry I did not get to commenting sooner.  Your #1 fan has been busy with the kids and the neighborhood kids since they too are off school today :(<br/> <br/>So you know, I think photos with very personal meanings don''t often translate well, because they mean so much more to you than anyone could ever appreciate.  I know we talked about what you were going to do and look what happened - you created an image the way you described to it me.  Definitely a morning scene, definitely from the perspective of your eyes as a child.  Excellent job of taking this from concept to creation.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Sorry I did not get to commenting sooner.  Your #1 fan has been busy with the kids and the neighborhood kids since they too are off school today :( So you know, I think photos with very personal meanings don''t often translate well, because they mean so much more to you than anyone could ever appreciate.  I know we talked about what you were going to do and look what happened - you created an image the way you described to it me.  Definitely a morning scene, definitely from the perspective of your eyes as a child.  Excellent job of taking this from concept to creation.   ', '2008-02-11 13:41:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4478165, 641619, 60805, '<td valign="top">A fitting ribbon to match those beautiful eyes, I love this one Garry.</td>', 'A fitting ribbon to match those beautiful eyes, I love this one Garry.', '2008-02-11 13:43:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4478297, 641958, 61651, '<td valign="top">A tomato on the lens?  Man, the lengths to which you will go...  Icky and about as real-looking as I can believe - you should have gotten a better score, if only for the effort at verisimilitude.  Honestly - the shot makes me queasy, wouldn''t be hanging a copy of it on my wall anytime soon, but dang, I bow to your superior imagination and ingenuity. :)</td>', 'A tomato on the lens?  Man, the lengths to which you will go...  Icky and about as real-looking as I can believe - you should have gotten a better score, if only for the effort at verisimilitude.  Honestly - the shot makes me queasy, wouldn''t be hanging a copy of it on my wall anytime soon, but dang, I bow to your superior imagination and ingenuity. :)', '2008-02-11 15:02:17.000000', NULL, 0),
