(4478837, 641619, 17513, '<td valign="top">well done/congratulations</td>', 'well done/congratulations', '2008-02-11 19:25:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4478841, 641972, 55838, '<td valign="top">Yay Jen!  Congratulations.  I''m glad to see this ribbon as it perfectly depicts the "looming" doors that we had to go thru on that first big day!  : )  Very well done.</td>', 'Yay Jen!  Congratulations.  I''m glad to see this ribbon as it perfectly depicts the "looming" doors that we had to go thru on that first big day!  : )  Very well done.', '2008-02-11 19:28:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4478870, 641705, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love the composition :-)</td>', 'I love the composition :-)', '2008-02-11 19:47:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4478872, 641929, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh my... you know, I liked this a whole lot.  I don''t like photos of this subject in general, because they are very overdone and I''m just tired of seeing them.  They have to have something unique to appeal to me.  This one did.  The uniqueness was the "dreamy" quality created by the softer focus.  I thought the dreamy quality fit quite nicely with this particular challenge.  And that''s why I love this photo so much more than his recent ribbon winning shot.</td>', 'Oh my... you know, I liked this a whole lot.  I don''t like photos of this subject in general, because they are very overdone and I''m just tired of seeing them.  They have to have something unique to appeal to me.  This one did.  The uniqueness was the "dreamy" quality created by the softer focus.  I thought the dreamy quality fit quite nicely with this particular challenge.  And that''s why I love this photo so much more than his recent ribbon winning shot.', '2008-02-11 19:50:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4478882, 642121, 53316, '<td valign="top">Personally I wouldn''t think you needed to apologize - it''s so great when people can own up to their mistakes.</td>', 'Personally I wouldn''t think you needed to apologize - it''s so great when people can own up to their mistakes.', '2008-02-11 19:54:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4478970, 641347, 53964, '<td valign="top">My post from the "Posthumous Ribbon of the Week" thread;<br/> <br/>Folks complained about the processing but I think it''s perfect for the sentiments expressed in the title. <br/> <br/>The perspective, from a distance... the feeling of now looking in as an outsider where one once belonged... <br/> <br/>The lack of contrast, the grain, the posterising... the distortion of childhood memories and dreams brought by those memories... <br/> <br/>I really can''t express it, but this shot strangely moved me.</td>', 'My post from the "Posthumous Ribbon of the Week" thread; Folks complained about the processing but I think it''s perfect for the sentiments expressed in the title.  The perspective, from a distance... the feeling of now looking in as an outsider where one once belonged...  The lack of contrast, the grain, the posterising... the distortion of childhood memories and dreams brought by those memories...  I really can''t express it, but this shot strangely moved me.', '2008-02-11 20:34:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4478973, 641577, 43714, '<td valign="top">Great shot, makes a person happy just to look at it!!!</td>', 'Great shot, makes a person happy just to look at it!!!', '2008-02-11 20:37:04.000000', NULL, 0),
