(4480597, 641368, 66384, '<td valign="top">Even thought I thought it was a good image, I didn''t score it very high. I didn''t think it really met the challenge, since I don''t believe anyone remembers this event. I am guessing that''s the reason the average score was low. But heck, what does that matter -- you got a good photo and had fun.</td>', 'Even thought I thought it was a good image, I didn''t score it very high. I didn''t think it really met the challenge, since I don''t believe anyone remembers this event. I am guessing that''s the reason the average score was low. But heck, what does that matter -- you got a good photo and had fun.', '2008-02-12 14:11:04.000000', NULL, 0),
