(4482863, 641972, 52115, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, This was one of the tops that caught my eye. I knew it was a winner. It would be interesting to see a hand reaching outof an opened door, with this fisheye. And maybe the back of a scared child (books in hand, no backpack).</td>', 'Congratulations, This was one of the tops that caught my eye. I knew it was a winner. It would be interesting to see a hand reaching outof an opened door, with this fisheye. And maybe the back of a scared child (books in hand, no backpack).', '2008-02-13 09:24:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4482952, 641084, 87808, '<td valign="top">Actually, I scored this very high.  It met the challenge more so than most of the other enterys.  WHy, becuase this truly could be a first memory.  You followed the rules to a T.  I really do not see why you got all the 1''s. I personally think you aced this challenge.</td>', 'Actually, I scored this very high.  It met the challenge more so than most of the other enterys.  WHy, becuase this truly could be a first memory.  You followed the rules to a T.  I really do not see why you got all the 1''s. I personally think you aced this challenge.', '2008-02-13 10:10:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4482963, 640982, 67697, '<td valign="top">How sweet is this?  I love the closeup and the composition.  It''s so emotive and I am sure that as you look at this years later, it will often bring a smile to your face.  I think I would have preferred a soft focus instead of the grain, but that''s just a personal taste kind of thing.  Cute pic!</td>', 'How sweet is this?  I love the closeup and the composition.  It''s so emotive and I am sure that as you look at this years later, it will often bring a smile to your face.  I think I would have preferred a soft focus instead of the grain, but that''s just a personal taste kind of thing.  Cute pic!', '2008-02-13 10:14:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4482968, 641900, 67697, '<td valign="top">Ahhh funny!  I think I even did this to my own kids.  And they still spit it back out of course.  I think the focus is perfect because that is all the kid''s really gonna focus on - the food!  They don''t care what color your shirt is!  hehe  Great interpretation.</td>', 'Ahhh funny!  I think I even did this to my own kids.  And they still spit it back out of course.  I think the focus is perfect because that is all the kid''s really gonna focus on - the food!  They don''t care what color your shirt is!  hehe  Great interpretation.', '2008-02-13 10:17:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4483027, 641782, 39218, '<td valign="top">This is dreamy and so reminiscent of my own childhood I would say it is my sentimental favourite, absolutely!</td>', 'This is dreamy and so reminiscent of my own childhood I would say it is my sentimental favourite, absolutely!', '2008-02-13 10:33:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4483030, 641630, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oooh this should have scored higher.  Excellent use of your lens to get this effect.  It''s got a dreamy quality but the subject makes it scary.  Wonderful job of translating what your mind''s eye sees!</td>', 'Oooh this should have scored higher.  Excellent use of your lens to get this effect.  It''s got a dreamy quality but the subject makes it scary.  Wonderful job of translating what your mind''s eye sees!', '2008-02-13 10:34:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4483128, 642111, 39218, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot in an amazing place... should have scored much higher...</td>', 'Amazing shot in an amazing place... should have scored much higher...', '2008-02-13 11:00:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4483136, 641342, 67697, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing on this.  It kind of gives it a 70s feel without looking dated (if that makes any sense).  I think it''s all the browns that make me think that lol.  I love the patterned carpet.  It''s so cute to see the two of them just sitting and reading.  Congrats on the top 10!</td>', 'I really like the processing on this.  It kind of gives it a 70s feel without looking dated (if that makes any sense).  I think it''s all the browns that make me think that lol.  I love the patterned carpet.  It''s so cute to see the two of them just sitting and reading.  Congrats on the top 10!', '2008-02-13 11:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4483898, 640982, 67237, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Grain, duotone and softness work very well here.<br/>I regret the senseless tendency of dpc voters to over-rate razor-sharpness, noislessness and eye-blinding saturation. <br/>In the real world of photography you must make choices like the one you did, depending on the story you are trying to tell. <br/>The same people who have voted 5- would have probably voted 7+ for this photo if the challenge was "grain". That means many voters will not see beyond the tip of their nose unless they are forced to.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-14 03:16:19.</i></td>', 'Very nicely done. Grain, duotone and softness work very well here.I regret the senseless tendency of dpc voters to over-rate razor-sharpness, noislessness and eye-blinding saturation. In the real world of photography you must make choices like the one you did, depending on the story you are trying to tell. The same people who have voted 5- would have probably voted 7+ for this photo if the challenge was "grain". That means many voters will not see beyond the tip of their nose unless they are forced to.', '2008-02-13 15:52:44.000000', '2008-02-14 03:16:19.000000', 0),
(4485257, 640982, 34462, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Love the way the texture and softness add to not only the softness of the baby but also with the idea of remembering something so far back.<br/></td>', 'Very nice. Love the way the texture and softness add to not only the softness of the baby but also with the idea of remembering something so far back.', '2008-02-13 21:55:27.000000', NULL, 0),
