(4493283, 641630, 53572, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful image, very evocative.  and thanks for the story too.  i only figured out in my late 20s why i was so scared to put the duvet over my head (i''m still not mad on it)  the duvet (which my son still uses) was bought by my parents when i was about 5.  i remember reading on the plastic bag - keep away from children, danger of suffocation.  of course, as a literal minded child, i took that to mean the duvet, not the bag.  oops...</td>', 'this is a wonderful image, very evocative.  and thanks for the story too.  i only figured out in my late 20s why i was so scared to put the duvet over my head (i''m still not mad on it)  the duvet (which my son still uses) was bought by my parents when i was about 5.  i remember reading on the plastic bag - keep away from children, danger of suffocation.  of course, as a literal minded child, i took that to mean the duvet, not the bag.  oops...', '2008-02-17 21:55:48.000000', NULL, 0),
